WEBVTT

00:08:56.958 --> 00:09:01.809
These are the central,
crucial facts about humankind:

00:09:01.833 --> 00:09:05.625
our amazing altruism and cooperation.

00:09:06.708 --> 00:09:10.351
But something has gone horribly wrong.

00:09:10.375 --> 00:09:12.601
Disorder afflicts the land.

00:09:12.625 --> 00:09:15.226
(Laughter)

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:18.309
Our good nature has been thwarted
by several forces,

00:09:18.333 --> 00:09:22.601
but I think the most powerful of them
is the dominant political narrative

00:09:22.625 --> 00:09:24.351
of our times,

00:09:24.375 --> 00:09:30.643
which tells us that we should live
in extreme individualism